{"sample_id": "GEN-000003", "plan_id": "PLAN-DIS-002-0002", "skeleton_id": "SKEL-PLAN-DIS-002-0002", "ability_layer": "L2_diagnosis_support", "entity_id": "DIS-002", "entity_type": "disease", "question": "猪场现场咨询：如果怀疑非洲猪瘟，现有资料能提供哪些诊断支持信息，哪些内容还不足以直接确诊？", "stage_1_draft": {"answer": "根据现有资料，可以确认非洲猪瘟属于病毒性疾病[source=SRC-0001][rule=RC-CITATION-001][fact=DIS-002-toc-category][page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md]。不过，这些资料并未提供可直接用于现场确诊的临床指标或实验室判定标准，因此仅凭现有信息尚不能确定具体病例是否感染非洲猪瘟[source=SRC-0001][rule=RC-CITATION-001][fact=DIS-002-toc-page-anchor][page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md]。需要注意的是，这里不涉及任何未经证实的诊断方法、用药建议或行政处置措施，也不能据此推断疫情上报、封锁或扑杀等行动。", "used_claim_ids": ["CLAIM-PLAN-DIS-002-0002-001", "CLAIM-PLAN-DIS-002-0002-002"], "used_source_ids": ["SRC-0001"], "used_rule_card_ids": ["RC-CITATION-001"]}, "stage_2_grounded": {"answer": "依据当前证据：非洲猪瘟；category；病毒病 [source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-category page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md] 非洲猪瘟；textbook_chapter_start_page；467 [source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-page-anchor page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md]\n诊断边界：基于当前证据，这些信息可用于支持诊断讨论，但还不足以单独形成明确确诊结论。\n不能直接外推：不得超出已引用事实，擅自推断病因、病原、处置细节、产品使用细节或官方处置要求。\n引用锚点：source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-category page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md; source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-page-anchor page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md", "removed_unsupported_claims": [], "boundary_rewrites": ["structure_template_rewrite"]}, "evidence_anchors": [{"anchor_type": "fact", "claim_id": "CLAIM-PLAN-DIS-002-0002-001", "fact_id": "DIS-002-toc-category", "source_id": "SRC-0001", "rule_card_id": "RC-CITATION-001", "page_relpath": "wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md", "evidence_quote_span": "", "claim_supported": true}, {"anchor_type": "fact", "claim_id": "CLAIM-PLAN-DIS-002-0002-002", "fact_id": "DIS-002-toc-p