{"sample_id": "GEN-000004", "plan_id": "PLAN-DIS-002-0003", "skeleton_id": "SKEL-PLAN-DIS-002-0003", "ability_layer": "L3_differential_support", "entity_id": "DIS-002", "entity_type": "disease", "question": "猪场兽医咨询：针对非洲猪瘟，现有资料能支持做到什么程度的鉴别诊断判断，哪些内容还不能下结论？", "stage_1_draft": {"answer": "根据现有资料，可以确认非洲猪瘟属于病毒性疾病[source=SRC-0001][rule=RC-CITATION-001][fact=DIS-002-toc-category][page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md]。在鉴别诊断上，这一点可以作为与细菌性疾病或其他非病毒性疫病区分的依据。不过，现有证据并未提供足够信息来判断该病与其他具体病毒病的差异特征，也无法据此直接得出临床诊断或防控措施的结论。因此，对于是否可与其他病毒病完全区分，以及具体的临床表现、传播路径等细节，目前仍无法下结论。", "used_claim_ids": ["CLAIM-PLAN-DIS-002-0003-001"], "used_source_ids": ["SRC-0001"], "used_rule_card_ids": ["RC-CITATION-001"]}, "stage_2_grounded": {"answer": "依据当前证据：非洲猪瘟；category；病毒病 [source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-category page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md] 非洲猪瘟；textbook_chapter_start_page；467 [source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-page-anchor page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md]\n鉴别边界：当前证据只能帮助划定鉴别诊断边界，可用于比较可能性，但不足以直接指向单一疾病结论。\n不能直接下结论：不得补充未引用的鉴别特征、处置选择、产品使用细节或官方处置要求。\n引用锚点：source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-category page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md; source=SRC-0001 rule=RC-CITATION-001 fact=DIS-002-toc-page-anchor page=wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md", "removed_unsupported_claims": [], "boundary_rewrites": ["structure_template_rewrite"]}, "evidence_anchors": [{"anchor_type": "fact", "claim_id": "CLAIM-PLAN-DIS-002-0003-001", "fact_id": "DIS-002-toc-category", "source_id": "SRC-0001", "rule_card_id": "RC-CITATION-001", "page_relpath": "wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-virus.md", "evidence_quote_span": "", "claim_supported": true}, {"anchor_type": "fact", "claim_id": "CLAIM-PLAN-DIS-002-0003-002", "fact_id": "DIS-002-toc-page-anchor", "source_id": "SRC-0001", "rule_card_id": "RC-CITATION-001", "page_relpath": "wiki/diseases/DIS-002-african-swine-fever-vir